# Reference only — the real .env is GENERATED, not copied from this file.
# .env is gitignored and assembled by scripts/build-env.sh from two sources:
#   - env.defaults  -> shared non-secret config (TZ, locale, history, color); committed
#   - env.local     -> ALL secrets (shared team + personal); gitignored, applied last / wins
#
# SETUP, from .devcontainer/ inside the container (`make help`):
#   1. cp local/env.local.example local/env.local
#   2. fill in local/env.local  (shared secrets from 1Password; personal PATs your own)
#   3. make build-env           # merges env.defaults + env.local -> local/.env
# On rebuild, post-create.sh runs build-env.sh automatically. Do not hand-edit .env.
#
# The keys a filled-in local/.env ends up containing:
#
# --- shared secrets (from env.local; team values via 1Password) ---
#   TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID, TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN, ROARK_API_KEY
#
# --- personal secrets (from env.local; your own tokens) ---
#   GITHUB_TOKEN, NPM_TOKEN, NGROK_AUTHTOKEN, JIRA_API_TOKEN, POSTHOG_PERSONAL_API_KEY
#
# --- non-secret shared config (from env.defaults, committed) ---
#   TZ, LANG, LC_ALL, HISTFILE, HISTSIZE, SAVEHIST, FORCE_COLOR, TWILIO_DEV_PHONE_FORCE
#
# See local/env.local.example for the annotated secret template.
